  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCCPA-Savalou | Cashew Promotion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Union seeks to increase the capacity of member cooperatives to produce, commercialize, and distribute cashews, through technical trainings, the construction of 5 trading posts, and better access to technology, equipment, and distribution channels.</narrative>
  </description>
